[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0745","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0745.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0494","title":"Deerfield WinGate POP3 代理缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"WinGate 代理服务器的 POP3 组件存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的 POP3 请求触发该漏洞，导致代理服务崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 WinGate 多个版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，危害等级中等。厂商已发布修复版本，建议用户升级至最新版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0494"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-07-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:31Z","remediation":"升级 WinGate 至 2.1d 或更高版本，该版本修复了 POP3 代理中的缓冲区溢出问题。如无法升级，可在 WinGate 服务配置中禁用 POP3 代理服务，或通过防火墙限制对 POP3 代理端口（默认 110）的访问，仅允许受信任 IP 连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0494"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0745.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0524","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0524.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0313","title":"SGI IRIX disk_bandwidth 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"SGI IRIX 6.4 S2MP（用于 Origin/Onyx2 服务器）的 disk_bandwidth 工具存在路径遍历漏洞，本地攻击者可通过使用相对路径名欺骗该工具加载恶意动态链接库，从而获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 SGI IRIX 6.4 版本，攻击者需要拥有本地访问权限，利用难度较低，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0313"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1998-07-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:07Z","remediation":"建议安装 SGI 安全公告 19980701-01-P 提供的修补程序，或升级至 IRIX 6.5 及以上版本。临时缓解措施可移除 disk_bandwidth 程序的 setuid root 权限：chmod u-s /usr/sbin/disk_bandwidth。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/936","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/213/exploit","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/214","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1441"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0524.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0526","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0526.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0314","title":"SGI IRIX 6.4 ioconfig 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"SGI IRIX 6.4 S2MP 系统的 ioconfig 工具在处理相对路径名时未进行充分的安全检查，本地攻击者可通过构造恶意的相对路径利用该漏洞，从而获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 SGI IRIX 6.4 操作系统的 Origin/Onyx2 平台，攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限才能触发，CVSS v2 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0314"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1998-07-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"SGI 已于 IRIX 6.5 及后续版本修复此漏洞，建议升级至 IRIX 6.5 或更高版本。如无法升级，可临时移除 ioconfig 的 setuid 权限：chmod u-s /sbin/ioconfig，或确保 PATH 环境变量中不包含当前目录以避免相对路径劫持。对于仍在运行 SGI IRIX 的生产环境，建议迁移至受支持的替代平台。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/6788","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/213","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/213/exploit","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1199"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0526.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1363","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1363.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1150","title":"Livingston Portmaster路由器 TCP初始序列号可预测漏洞","description":"Livingston Portmaster 路由器上运行的 ComOS 操作系统在建立 TCP 连接时使用固定的初始序列号（ISN），导致攻击者无需通过正常的 TCP 三次握手即可预测并伪造序列号。远程攻击者可利用此漏洞构造伪造的 TCP 数据包实施会话劫持或 IP 欺骗攻击，绕过认证机制获取未授权访问。该漏洞影响运行 ComOS 的 Livingston Portmaster 系列路由器，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。厂商已不再维护该产品，建议升级至替代方案。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1150"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-06-30T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:49Z","remediation":"升级 ComOS 固件至启用了随机 TCP 初始序列号（ISN）生成的版本（Livingston 已发布相关安全更新）。若无法升级，在网络边界启用 IPsec 加密或 TCP MD5 签名选项（RFC 2385）防止会话劫持与欺骗，同时在路由器 ACL 中限制仅允许可信 IP 访问 Telnet/SSH 管理端口（23/TCP）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/9723","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1882","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/30c3a896d257362f7419b0c772be2f3dd063ccaa/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1150.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1150","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1150.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9b79b5eac5a874eeb91f0d9e37084feed8b830f5/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1150.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdfc8886d71af7ef3bdab3e4db46753ff8af6538/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vxxg-9388-x757/GHSA-vxxg-9388-x757.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88515/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1150.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154100_154200.json","https://github.com/Ethishh/securin_assessment/blob/e6ce9197b6593ae46f3f5646d268181eea6cbb31/cve_sync.log","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--2e3c944c-9364-4251-9a74-0cb99868e123.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1363.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1275","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1275.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1441","title":"Linux Kernel SIGIO 信号任意进程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 2.0.34 版本中存在信号处理不当的漏洞，由于未正确限制用户向任意进程发送 SIGIO 信号的权限，本地攻击者可向未捕获该信号的进程发送恶意 SIGIO 信号，导致目标进程异常终止或拒绝服务。该漏洞为本地利用，攻击者需具有系统本地访问权限，影响 Linux 2.0/2.1 系列内核版本，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1441"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1998-06-30T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:26Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 2.2.x 或更高版本，该系列内核已限制普通用户向任意进程发送 SIGIO 信号的权限。如无法升级内核，可通过内核参数或 grsec/PAX 等安全模块限制信号发送权限作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=90221103126047&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/111","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19085","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a131a61f179c398a4ef435924df81458086a9cb6/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1441.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1441","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1441.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9849013fb49e540f15cffd30644fcdcb875c1d4f/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1441.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/de3f834577328e71a123358d1db2b1637bc19e8a/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-464h-jp73-4qp4/GHSA-464h-jp73-4qp4.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1441.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/111/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154100_154200.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000321.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/7822e9dfcb4edcc4c84fcf2348d55e258c7243ca/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1275.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1275.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1552","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1552.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1556","title":"Microsoft SQL Server 6.5 权限提升漏洞","description":"Microsoft SQL Server 6.5 的 SQLExecutiveCmdExec 账户密码采用弱加密算法进行保护，并将加密后的密码存储于注册表可访问区域中。本地攻击者可通过读取注册表中 CmdExecAccount 值并破解弱加密密码，从而获取该账户的访问权限，实现本地权限提升。该漏洞影响 Microsoft SQL Server 6.5 版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。建议升级至更高版本或采取更强密码保护措施。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1556"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1998-06-29T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:42Z","remediation":"立即升级到受支持的 SQL Server 版本（如 2019/2022），因 SQL Server 6.5 已停止安全更新。限制注册表项 HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\MSSQLServer\\SQLExecutive\\CmdExecAccount 的访问权限，仅允许 SYSTEM 和 Administrators 组读取。改用 Windows 集成身份验证替代 CmdExecAccount 明文密码存储方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=90222453431645&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/109","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7354","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e37edb84f090321c2ab4b4aefc57f84a75b1b940/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1556.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1556","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-1999-1556.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f73aeebc806b7ab5e9488498a056b9fa7bf30dd7/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1556.json","https://github.com/dependency-check/DependencyCheck/blob/7dcfc0737c21744b423c2198ae979003c2eb67e2/core/src/main/resources/dependencycheck-base-suppression.xml","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/1999/1xxx/cve-1999-1556.yaml","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/109/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1556.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154100_154200.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1552.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1153","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1153.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0797","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"cachedReadTokens\":1664,\"inputTokens\":9128,\"outputTokens\":17,\"totalTokens\":10809}}","description":"SunOS 系统的 NIS（网络信息服务）finger 服务存在拒绝服务漏洞。该服务的 finger 守护进程在处理客户端 finger 请求时，每收到一个请求便会向 NIS 服务发起查询。攻击者在未经过身份认证的情况下，可向目标主机连续发送大量 finger 请求，迫使系统产生海量 NIS 查询，从而大量消耗 CPU 与网络资源，最终导致目标系统服务不可用。该漏洞影响运行 SunOS 且启用 NIS 与 finger 服务的系统，本地网络可达的远程攻击者可利用此缺陷实施拒绝服务攻击。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0797"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-06-29T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:04Z","remediation":"升级到 Sun Solaris 2.6 或更高版本并应用 Sun 安全补丁 105785-01 (SPARC) 或 105786-01 (x86)；或在 /etc/inetd.conf 中注释掉 finger 服务并重启 inetd 禁用 finger 服务；或使用 TCP Wrappers (/etc/hosts.allow/deny) 限制 finger 服务仅允许受信任 IP 访问；或在防火墙层面封锁 TCP 79 端口阻断 finger 请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/i-070.shtml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fe807f4098db5a5ad8dcb41a479197724cb9e789/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0797.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0797","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-0797.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f7f250b0cc5cc23741447612a2f182f04c36db78/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0797.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f61040ac78eb76aff0a3a68a8a8a4562940d3711/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-pj4v-m2mp-56cp/GHSA-pj4v-m2mp-56cp.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0797.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88388/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154100_154200.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt","https://github.com/Ethishh/securin_assessment/blob/e6ce9197b6593ae46f3f5646d268181eea6cbb31/cve_sync.log"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1153.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0797","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0797.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0797","title":"Sun SunOS NIS finger服务拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Sun SunOS操作系统中NIS finger服务存在拒绝服务漏洞。攻击者可发送大量finger请求触发大量NIS查询，消耗系统与网络资源，造成服务不可用。利用复杂度较高，需网络访问能力，无需认证。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0797"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1998-06-29T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级到已修复该问题的SunOS版本，或在NIS配置中禁用finger服务，并通过防火墙限制对finger端口的外部访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T10:46:57Z","references":["http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/i-070.shtml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0797.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0797.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0039","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0039.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0007","title":"OpenSSL PKCS#1 填充加密会话信息泄露漏洞","description":"该漏洞由贝尔实验室研究员 Daniel Bleichenbacher 于 1998 年发现，涉及 SSL 协议中 RSA PKCS #1 v1.5 填充方式的侧信道攻击。远程攻击者首先截获客户端与服务器之间的加密 SSL 会话，随后向服务器发送约一百万个精心构造的密文，通过观察服务器返回的填充校验错误差异逐步推断出会话密钥，最终解密被截获的加密通信内容。该漏洞影响 SSLeay 加密库及使用 SSL 协议的大量产品，包括 Microsoft Internet Information Server 3.0/4.0、Netscape Enterprise Server、Exchange Server 5.5 等服务器软件。由于攻击需要大量交互查询，服务器 CPU 和网络流量异常上升可作为检测手段。Microsoft 已于安全公告 MS98-002 中发布修补程序更新 SCHANNEL.dll。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0007"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-06-26T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:19Z","remediation":"立即将 SSLeay 升级至 OpenSSL 0.9.6 或更新版本，该版本修复了 PKCS #1 填充预言机信息泄露缺陷。如无法升级，在服务端禁用 SSLv2 协议，仅启用 TLS 1.0+，并配置统一的错误返回消息以防止攻击者通过错误响应区分填充格式。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1998/ms98-002"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0039.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1296","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1296.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1038","title":"Tiger 安全审计工具 2.2.3 符号链接攻击任意文件写入漏洞","description":"Tiger 2.2.3 安全审计工具在临时文件处理机制中存在严重漏洞。攻击者可通过操纵默认工作目录（WORKDIR）下的临时文件创建符号链接，诱使程序覆盖原始文件，实现对任意系统文件的写入操作。此漏洞影响虎嗅安全工具的默认配置，攻击者无需网络即可通过本地权限执行攻击，实现文件权限提升和系统文件破坏。攻击过程通过精心构造的符号链接链，实现对目标文件的完全控制，包括读取、修改和删除，可能导致敏感信息泄露或系统崩溃。漏洞利用时攻击者需具备本地用户权限，但一旦成功可获得系统级文件访问权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1038"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1998-06-26T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 Tiger 安全审计工具至 2.2.4 或更高版本，此版本修复了临时文件创建过程中的符号链接验证漏洞。具体修复措施包括：1. 在创建临时文件时验证文件路径的真实性，防止符号链接攻击；2. 使用原子操作创建临时文件；3. 限制临时文件权限，避免未经授权的访问；4. 建议用户将 WORKDIR 目录权限设置为仅当前用户可访问（chmod 700），并定期清理临时文件以降低风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=90221103125976&w=2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a3a08d51f200d453300fca8b852aada6b8c5985a/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1038.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1296.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-1296.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1296.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1295","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1295.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1037","title":"SATAN 1.1.1 rex.satan 符号链接任意文件覆盖漏洞","description":"SATAN 1.1.1 的 rex.satan 脚本在创建临时文件时使用了固定的绝对路径 /tmp/rex.$$，本地用户可通过预先创建指向目标文件（如系统关键文件或其他用户文件）的符号链接，使 rex.satan 脚本在运行时将内容写入该链接所指向的文件，从而实现任意文件覆盖。攻击者需具备本地访问权限且在目标用户运行 SATAN 之前完成符号链接的布置，可能导致权限提升或破坏系统完整性。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1037"],"sources":["cve","avd"],"published":"1998-06-26T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"避免使用固定的 /tmp/rex.$$ 绝对路径创建临时文件，改用 mkstemp 等安全临时文件生成方式，或采用相对路径（如 ./rex.$$）并配合 O_EXCL 标志创建文件；如无法升级，请以受限权限运行 SATAN 并清理 /tmp 下相关临时文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=90221103125976&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=90221103125986&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7167.php","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-1999-1037","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a3a08d51f200d453300fca8b852aada6b8c5985a/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1037.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1295.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1294","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1294.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1036","title":"COPS 1.04 符号链接攻击致任意文件覆盖漏洞","description":"COPS 1.04 版本在处理临时文件时存在符号链接攻击漏洞。程序在执行 res_diff、ca.src 和 mail.chk 等组件时，以不安全的方式创建临时文件，未对文件路径进行充分验证。本地攻击者可利用符号链接攻击，在 COPS 创建临时文件前将符号链接指向目标系统文件，从而实现对任意文件的覆盖或创建操作。成功利用此漏洞可导致攻击者获取系统完全控制权限，造成机密性、完整性和可用性的全面丧失。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1036"],"sources":["cve","avd"],"published":"1998-06-26T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 COPS 至修复了临时文件符号链接问题的版本，或应用厂商提供的安全补丁。临时缓解措施包括：以受限专用用户身份运行 COPS，将临时目录设置为仅该用户可写（如 chmod 700 /tmp/cops-tmp），并确保程序使用 O_EXCL 标志创建临时文件以防止符号链接攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=90221103125976&w=2"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1294.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1280","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1280.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1479","title":"Matt Wright textcounter.pl 任意命令执行漏洞","description":"Matt Wright 的 textcounter.pl 1.2 版本存在任意命令执行漏洞，由于 CGI 脚本未对用户输入进行充分过滤，远程攻击者可通过构造包含 Shell 元字符的恶意参数（如分号、反引号、管道符等）注入任意系统命令，导致在 Web 服务器权限下执行任意代码。该漏洞影响所有部署该版本计数器脚本的 Web 站点，CVSS 评分 10.0（严重），攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，仅需向目标 URL 发送精心构造的 HTTP 请求即可触发漏洞，获取服务器控制权。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1479"],"sources":["cve","avd"],"published":"1998-06-24T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 textcounter.pl 至最新版本或应用官方补丁，对用户输入中的 shell 元字符（如分号、反引号、管道符、美元符号）进行严格过滤或转义后再传递给系统命令。如无可用补丁，建议立即移除该脚本，改用支持输入验证的替代方案（如 CGI::Minimal），并在 Web 服务器层面限制对该脚本的访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/9609","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2265","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/2052"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1280.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-1280.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1280.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1276","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1276.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1442","title":"AMD K6处理器 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"AMD K6 处理器与 Linux 2.0.x 及 2.1.x 内核配合使用时存在拒绝服务漏洞。本地攻击者可通过执行特定的指令序列触发该漏洞，该指令序列涉及越段内存地址访问（访问段外地址），导致内核崩溃，系统无法正常运行。该漏洞影响搭载 AMD K6 处理器且运行 Linux 2.0.x 和 2.1.x 内核的系统，攻击者需具备本地访问权限，无需高权限即可利用，危害较高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1442"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1998-06-22T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:26Z","remediation":"升级至 Linux 内核 2.2.0 或更新版本，该版本已修复 AMD K6 处理器在特定指令序列下访问越界地址导致系统崩溃的问题。受影响的版本为 2.0.0~2.0.39 及 2.1.0~2.1.132，应立即停止使用这些已终止支持的内核分支。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://uwsg.iu.edu/hypermail/linux/kernel/9805.3/0855.html","http://www.cs.helsinki.fi/linux/linux-kernel/Year-1998/1998-25/0816.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/105","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19082","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cc228e85e595b2c95bda5544193864b06177c050/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1442.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1442","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1442.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9849013fb49e540f15cffd30644fcdcb875c1d4f/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1442.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/de3f834577328e71a123358d1db2b1637bc19e8a/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-wrvw-4qm4-87pm/GHSA-wrvw-4qm4-87pm.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1442.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--011378fc-d2e7-47ad-94e5-b389543930b3.json","https://github.com/shamedgh/confine/blob/a75dad3ad336e6258a42cd1ce4af061eea68ed76/cve.files/cveToFile.json.type.csv","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1276.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1139","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1139.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0783","title":"FreeBSD 2.2 NFS 设备文件硬链接拒绝服务漏洞","description":"FreeBSD 2.2 及更早版本在通过 NFS 导出文件系统时，未正确限制对设备特殊文件（如 /dev 下的块设备与字符设备）创建硬链接的权限。本地或具有 NFS 挂载访问权限的攻击者可利用此缺陷，在导出的文件系统上创建指向设备文件的硬链接并反复访问，导致系统资源被异常占用或内核处理异常，进而引发拒绝服务。攻击条件为攻击者需能挂载或访问受影响的 NFS 导出目录，并在其中创建硬链接。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0783"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-06-16T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:02Z","remediation":"建议升级到 FreeBSD 3.0 或更高版本，该问题已在后续版本中修复。若无法立即升级，应限制本地用户对设备特殊文件（/dev 目录）的访问权限，并避免将设备文件所在目录通过 NFS 导出；同时可在挂载 NFS 文件系统时添加 nodev 选项，禁止在该文件系统上解释设备文件，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/i-057.shtml","http://www.osvdb.org/6090","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/19dfa989c2a07b8fd71870a139a7d171f621ff41/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0783.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1139.toml"}]